{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attack of Bunnies</strong> is a fast-paced, story-driven shooter that seamlessly blends third-person action with top-down combat. Set against the backdrop of a futuristic sci-fi universe, you\u2019ll uncover the sinister plot of the evil scientist Jaxx\u2014whose bizarre experiments have unleashed havoc across the galaxy. Take control of multiple unique characters, each equipped with distinct abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your heroes using straightforward RPG mechanics, utilizing\u00a0 power ups as you progress through an array of challenging levels and atmospheric environments. Whether blasting through hordes of mutated minions in third-person mode from a top-down perspective with replayable levels with four difficulties, <strong>Attack of Bunnies</strong> delivers intense gunfights, compelling storytelling, and an accessible progression system that keeps the action fresh. Upgrade your weapons, and prepare for the ultimate showdown against Jaxx\u2019s twisted creations!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480720?t=1745226931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480720?t=1745226931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480720/e501200a6b62b8881bead94d5d4a2a2a352fbc83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745226931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480720/e501200a6b62b8881bead94d5d4a2a2a352fbc83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745226931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3489320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Attack of Bunnies</strong> is